# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for test/asan/run.sh tsan.
#
# Only the NIF shim is built with -fsanitize=thread (ENGINE_SANITIZE=thread);
# sofia and the BEAM are not, so TSan sees their memory accesses only
# through the libc and pthread calls it intercepts.
# Nothing here may match a frame of c_src/nif/ or sofia-sip:
# a race on a NIF call path is always reported.
